// uefi-post: the vibe86 UEFI firmware (build/fw/vibe86.fd) from reset on the
// test board: SEC, PEI and DXE run, and BDS shows the POST screen on COM1
// (the console's VT100 terminal) and on the VGA text screen.
// Milestone 1 of fw/README.md.
// vsim-args: -b test -M 128 -c 8000000
// expect-exit: 3   (the cycle limit: the firmware waits at its setup prompt)
// expect-out: vibe86 UEFI 0.1
// expect-out: CPU   : vibe86 Venice-class microcoded processor
// expect-out: Total Memory: 128 MB
// expect-vga: vibe86 UEFI 0.1
// expect-vga: Press <DEL> or <F2> to enter setup, <F11> or <F12> for the boot menu.
